"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[51554],{51554:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/death-2.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Death 2\\"\\n          author=\\"Bernard Werber\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Open Books\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2019-05-30\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788932919683\\"\\n          rating=2.5\\n          tags=\\"sf\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe story gets weirder as it goes on.  \\nThe premise and the beginning were good, but the content gradually goes off the rails.  \\n<br>\\nMoments where classic mystery writers or historical figures appear to talk about their past glory are quite amusing.  \\n<br>\\nHowever, I was personally disappointed by the overall progression and the conclusion.  \\nIt felt like the author used a \'world where anything is possible\' to forcedly wrap up all the loose ends.  \\n<br>\\nStill, it retains the fresh imaginative qualities characteristic of <mark>Bernard Werber</mark>\'s novels, so it was worth a read."}')}}]);